/--
Definition of `IsGenerating` / `IsGenerating` 的定义

English:
class IsGenerating
  parameters: : Prop where
  axioms and operations (1):
    - le({X : C} (S : Sieve X) (hS : S in J X)) : exists (E : J.OneHypercover X) (_ : H E), E.sieve₀ <= S

中文:
类 是Generating
