class IsGenerating : Prop where
  le {X : C} (S : Sieve X) (hS : S in J X) :
    exists (E : J.OneHypercover X) (_ : H E), E.sieve₀ <= S

/--
lemma `exists_oneHypercover` / 引理 `exists_oneHypercover`

English:
lemma exists_oneHypercover
  given: [H.IsGenerating] {X : C} (S : Sieve X) (hS : S in J X)
  proof: IsGenerating.le _ hS

中文:
引理 存在_oneHypercover
  条件: [H.是Generating] {X : C} (S : 筛 X) (hS : S in J X)
  证明: IsGenerating.le _ hS

Depends on / 依赖: IsGenerating, IsGenerating.le
